  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Free healthcare provision in the Democratic Republic of Congo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Free healthcare provision in the Democratic Republic of Congo is a component of Access to Healthcare in the Democratic Republic of Congo reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;78,435,923. It works in the following sector(s): Infectious disease control, Basic health care, Health policy and administrative management, STD control including HIV/AIDS, Reproductive health care.</narrative>
  </description>
